  "hub_id": null,
  "guid": "com.manimal.csgas",
  "name": "Manimal's CS Gas",
  "slug": "manimals-cs-gas",
  "teaser": "A mod that adds the CS Gas grenade from 1.0",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/tY52uesE8rssISaCxnF3q8htzjTcNhmApm79LspW.png",
  "downloads": 2032,
  "favourites_count": 29,
  "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">The Mod</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>This mod adds a custom Grenade type: The Model 8230 CS gas grenade. It works similar to 1.0 with volumetric gas propagation, and the effects can be mitigated using a gas mask or respirator.</p>\n<p>They can also be used as tripwires.</p>\n<div class=\"youtube-lite\" data-video-id=\"rMWxuVeHp8w\" data-embed-url=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/rMWxuVeHp8w?autoplay=1\"><img src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/rMWxuVeHp8w/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"YouTube video thumbnail\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Installation</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Drag it into the folder baby.\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://imgur.com/34vXXDj.gif\" alt=\"alt text\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Where to find me</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li>Here <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://discord.com/channels/478334515488751617/1496355574579859556\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">(WTT Discord Channel)</a></li>\n<li>And here <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://discord.gg/z8g9VC2W2c\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">(My EVIL Discord Server….)</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>If you like my work and wish to support me, you can do so <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/manimal1920\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">here.</a></p></div></div></div>\n",
  "detail_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2864/manimals-cs-gas",
